OL,3,GNEWSAHeatwaves drive record-breaking
OL,4,Ademand on NHS services in Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe recent heatwave has driven a demand
OL,7,Fon the NHS services in Wales, according
OL,8,Fto the latest figures.
OL,10,FFor the third month in a row, the total
OL,11,Fnumbers waiting for treatment by the
OL,12,FNHS in Wales have risen, though
OL,13,Ftwo-year-waits have dropped slightly.
OL,15,FThere were just under 698,400 patient
OL,16,Fpathways, which represent a patient's
OL,17,Fjourney through NHS services, in June -
OL,18,Fan increase of about 8,700.
OL,20,FIt is estimated the figures include
OL,21,F547,500 individual patients, as many
OL,22,Fare on more than one waiting list.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
